Stdout:
ST118  Response carries fields the schema does not declare
checks response_schema_conformance

gRPC response with fields its message, as the server reflects it, does not
declare.

Applies to schemas loaded through reflection only: the server sends fields its
own reflected descriptors lack, so the reflection data is stale or the response
is built from a different message.

`--exclude-checks response_schema_conformance` turns it off, along with ST109,
ST110, ST111, ST114, ST115, ST116, ST117.
